            "repere": "Paragraphe · Raised T in men 45 to 55. Pandit et al.,",
            "text": "Raised T in men 45 to 55. Pandit et al., 2016: healthy men aged 45 to 55 took purified shilajit, 250 mg twice a day, for 90 days. Total testosterone, free testosterone and DHEAS all ended significantly higher than placebo (P &lt; 0.05; PMID 26395129).*",
