            "slot": "s572",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Stamina that holds up. Keller et al., 20",
            "text": "Stamina that holds up. Keller et al., 2019: in 63 active men (average age 21), the stronger half on 500 mg a day lost 8.9% of their strength after a fatiguing leg workout, against 16.0% on placebo (p = 0.044). 250 mg: no better than placebo (PMID 30728074).*",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
